{"sha": "48b94a9118010662eb30bbb3c1467842cf7b4d98fe981d9bca0f925aae5a6747", "body": ["\\chapter{指数函数与对数函数}\\label{ch:g12:exp}", "", "指数函数是唯一与其自身导数相等的函数，", "并以 $1$ 为其在 $0$ 处的值。它把和化为积；其逆函数", "即自然对数，把积化为和。二者共同刻画", "凡变化率与其大小成正比的现象：", "放射性衰变、人口增长、复利。", "", "\\section{指数函数}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[存在性与唯一性]\\label{thm:g12:exp:existence}", "存在唯一的可导函数 $f \\colon \\R \\to \\R$，使得", "\\[", "f' = f \\qquad\\text{且}\\qquad f(0) = 1 .", "\\]", "该函数称为\\emph{指数函数}\\index{指数函数}，记作", "$\\exp$，或 $x \\mapsto \\eu^x$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[唯一性的证明]", "首先，这样的函数永不为零。事实上，设", "$g(x) = f(x)f(-x)$，则", "\\[", "g'(x) = f'(x)f(-x) - f(x)f'(-x) = f(x)f(-x) - f(x)f(-x) = 0,", "\\]", "因此 $g$ 为常数，且 $g(0) = 1$：对每个 $x$，", "$f(x)f(-x) = 1$，特别地 $f(x) \\neq 0$。", "", "现设 $f_1, f_2$ 为两个解，令 $h = \\dfrac{f_1}{f_2}$（", "由于 $f_2$ 永不为零）。于是", "\\[", "h' = \\frac{f_1' f_2 - f_1 f_2'}{f_2^2} = \\frac{f_1 f_2 - f_1 f_2}{f_2^2} = 0,", "\\]", "因此 $h$ 为常数，且 $h(0) = 1$，\\emph{即} $f_1 = f_2$。", "", "\\emph{存在性}在本阶段不加证明地承认（它可以", "由\\cref{exo:g12:seq:10}中的数列得到，或作为", "在\\cref{ch:g12:integ}中通过积分构造的对数函数的反函数得到）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[函数方程]\\label{prop:g12:exp:funceq}", "对所有 $x, y \\in \\R$ 及 $n \\in \\Z$：", "\\[", "\\eu^{x+y} = \\eu^x\\,\\eu^y, \\qquad", "\\eu^{-x} = \\frac{1}{\\eu^x}, \\qquad", "\\eu^{x-y} = \\frac{\\eu^x}{\\eu^y}, \\qquad", "\\bigl(\\eu^{x}\\bigr)^n = \\eu^{nx}.", "\\]", "此外，$\\eu^x > 0$ 对所有 $x$ 成立。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "固定 $y$，考虑 $\\varphi(x) = \\dfrac{\\exp(x+y)}{\\exp(x)\\exp(y)}$。", "其分子与分母作为 $x$ 的函数，都是", "$f' = f$ 的解（在相差常数 $\\exp(y)$ 的意义下）；直接对 $\\varphi$ 求导", "（利用商的求导法则）得 $\\varphi' = 0$，因此", "$\\varphi \\equiv \\varphi(0) = 1$，即得第一个等式。取", "$y = -x$ 即得第二式（其中 $\\eu^0 = 1$），", "第三式随之可得。第四式由第一式对 $n \\geq 0$ 用归纳法得到，", "再由第二式推广到 $n < 0$。", "", "正性：$\\eu^x = \\left(\\eu^{x/2}\\right)^2 \\geq 0$，且 $\\eu^x \\neq 0$", "（见\\cref{thm:g12:exp:existence}），故 $\\eu^x > 0$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[变化与极限]\\label{prop:g12:exp:variations}", "指数函数严格递增、凸，且", "\\[", "\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty} \\eu^x = 0, \\qquad", "\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty} \\eu^x = +\\infty .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由 $(\\exp)' = \\exp > 0$ 得严格递增；由 $(\\exp)'' = \\exp > 0$ 得", "凸性。由凸性，$\\eu^x \\geq 1 + x$（在 $0$ 处的切线，见", "\\cref{ex:g12:deriv:ineq}），由比较可得 $\\eu^x \\to +\\infty$（当 $x \\to +\\infty$ 时）。", "再由 $\\eu^{x} = 1/\\eu^{-x} \\to 0$（当 $x \\to -\\infty$ 时）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.8cm, height=6cm,", "  xmin=-3.3, xmax=2.4, ymin=-2.4, ymax=7.8,", "  xtick={-2,-1,1,2}, ytick={1}]", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=-3.2:2.3] {1 + x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-3.2:2.0] {exp(x)};", "  \\fill (axis cs:0,1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, anchor=east] at (axis cs:1.35,5.2) {$\\eu^x$};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\small, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:1.05,1.6) {$y = 1+x$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 指数函数：严格递增、凸，且", "$\\lim_{-\\infty} \\eu^x = 0$。其图像位于它在 $0$ 处的切线上方：", "$\\eu^x \\geq 1 + x$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[增长比较]\\label{thm:g12:exp:growth}", "\\index{增长比较}", "对每个整数 $n \\geq 1$，", "\\[", "\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty} \\frac{\\eu^x}{x^n} = +\\infty,", "\\qquad", "\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty} x^n \\eu^x = 0 .", "\\]", "换言之，指数函数的增长快于 $x$ 的任意次幂。", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}